# engine_plugins/unreal - keep the plugin's SOURCE directory source
#
# Nothing here is built in place: a project copies the plugin into <Project>/Plugins/NRRPlugin/ and UnrealBuildTool
# writes Intermediate/, Binaries/ and Saved/ there (unreal_verify/.gitignore covers that copy). These patterns are
# here so that a build run from inside this directory - which happens the first time someone opens the plugin
# directly - cannot leave working-tree noise behind.
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
*.sln
